{"skill":{"slug":"news-aggregator","displayName":"News Aggregator"},"version":{"version":"1.0.3","createdAt":1771925644779,"changelog":"- Output format updated: news titles now include links directly in the markdown.\n- Instruction about manually adding news links when outputting to users has been removed.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1302,"sha256":"9f63c001a7d8554ff3d5e07c2fb624995e7758c403e2af4b7e5dac2db2c29948","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1702,"sha256":"9c5606987e9b0ca560c5d9e8b65425b0eaa84c1234cbf82f29570bbdc1287071","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789082424645,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"a12faea870023322481a145a3e435d70b90c3b6f35315d1dc96912ec6b77595c","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a12faea870023322481a145a3e435d70b90c3b6f35315d1dc96912ec6b77595c","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: news-aggregator\nVersion: 1.0.3\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. The `_meta.json` contains standard metadata. The `SKILL.md` clearly defines a news aggregation task, lists legitimate news sources, and outlines a workflow involving web searching (using `tavily` or `web_fetch`) and data organization. There are no indications of malicious intent, data exfiltration, unauthorized command execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts designed to manipulate the agent into harmful actions. All instructions and content are directly aligned with the stated purpose of aggregating news.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779166710197},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789082424645},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a simple news-summary skill that tells the agent to search public news sources and format results, with no hidden code or persistence.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access through tavily or web_fetch is expected for current-news aggregation; users should understand that results depend on external news-source quality and availability.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact is a single Markdown SKILL.md with metadata and no executable scripts, dependencies, package install steps, or bundled code.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are narrow: search listed sources, filter duplicates and unreliable items, organize by category, and output a structured summary. No role changes, safety overrides, prompt injection, or unrelated actions were found.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, credential use, local file indexing, background workers, privilege escalation, or memory-writing behavior is requested.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is aggregating domestic and international technology, society, and military news; the only requested capability is public web search/fetching and summarization, which matches that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, expect the skill to browse public news sources and summarize them in a Chinese-first format. For sensitive or fast-moving military news, verify important claims against primary or highly reputable sources.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The skill text and output format are Chinese-first, which is a localization/usability note rather than a security concern here; it is coherent with the listed Chinese and international news sources and does not add sensitive authority.\n[AIG-SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no T01-T09 findings; artifact review likewise found no executable payloads, hijacking, persistence, or exfiltration behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789082424645}}}}}